---
import { SUBMISSION_EMAIL } from '../consts';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="footer-inner">
		<div class="footer-mark"><span>花花<br />有期</span><i>●</i><small>HUĀHUĀ<br />PERIODICAL</small></div>
		<p>一本按周生长、按月装订、按年收藏的个人刊物。<br />把日子装订成册。</p>
		<div class="footer-meta">
			<span>© {year} 花花有期</span>
			<span class="feeds"><a href="/submit">欢迎投稿</a><a href={`mailto:${SUBMISSION_EMAIL}`}>{SUBMISSION_EMAIL}</a><a href="/rss.xml">文章 RSS</a><a href="/weekly/rss.xml">周刊 RSS</a><a href="/feed.json">JSON Feed</a><a href="/data/v1/site.json">开放数据</a></span>
			<span>SET IN SOURCE SERIF</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer { padding: 0 2rem 3rem; background: var(--bg-soft); }
	.footer-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: auto; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 3px double var(--fg); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr; gap: 2rem; }
	.footer-mark { display: flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--fg); }
	.footer-mark i { color: var(--accent); font-size: .55rem; margin: 0 .5rem; }
	.footer-mark small { color: var(--fg-muted); font: .5rem/1.3 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .13em; }
	p { margin: 0; max-width: 34rem; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.8; }
	.footer-meta { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--fg-muted); }
	a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
	a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
	.feeds { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: .8rem; }
	@media (max-width: 640px) { .site-footer { padding: 0 1.1rem 2rem; } .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .footer-meta { grid-column: 1; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; } }
</style>
